# Design System

- Define hex/rgba only in `theme/promptanatomy/static/css/tokens.css`.
- Do not add new hardcoded hex/rgba in other `theme/**/css/*.css` files — use `var(--token)`.
- Do not hardcode hex colors in Jinja templates (SVG assets from mother repo are exceptions; document in DESIGN_SYSTEM.md).
- Light reading surfaces (`--color-surface`, `--color-surface-elevated`); dark bands use `.section--dark`.
- Body uses `--text-body` (18px); article column `--article-max` (720px); container `--container-max` (75rem).
- Gold CTAs: `.btn--primary` only. Prose links: `--color-link` in `.prose` only.
- Token catalog and button rules: `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` (v2.0). Pre-release checklist: `docs/VISUAL_QA.md`.
- Reuse `macros/ui.html` for `btn`, `card`, `section_heading` (pass `heading_id` when section uses `aria-labelledby`).
- After theme changes: `make validate` runs `scripts/validate_theme_tokens.py`; update `docs/COMPONENT_MAP.md` if partials change.
- Allowed motion: card hover, reading progress, TOC active state.
- Forbidden: parallax, heavy animation, neon gradients, magazine clutter.
